        "successMetrics": [
          "A connection between graphs and a bridge route are drawn by the same layer, in the same styles and classes.",
          "Where several edges leave one port they share a trunk the way they do in graph space.",
          "Each piece of workspace edge code is either used by that renderer or removed."
